---
const { tournament = false } = Astro.props;
---

<details>
  <summary>Match rules</summary>
  <p>
    Each tick, both players can move their paddle one cell up or down, or hold
    still. A missed return gives the opponent one point. If the ball is still in
    play after 192 ticks, the rally is a draw and neither player scores.
  </p>
  {
    tournament ? (
      <>
        <p>
          First to eight points wins a match. Drawn rallies score zero and play
          continues with the next serve. Best of five means the first player to
          win three matches wins the series.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every pair plays one series in the round robin. Series wins determine
          the knockout seeds. Ties go to match wins minus losses, then points
          scored minus conceded, then entry order.
        </p>
        <p>
          Everyone enters the knockout. The highest seed opens against the
          lowest. Each series winner advances until one champion remains.
        </p>
      </>
    ) : (
      <p>
        A head-to-head match lasts eight rallies. Each of four starting
        positions is played twice, once from each side. The player with more
        points wins. Equal scores give a draw.
      </p>
    )
  }
</details>
